# Original Fractint 20.04p17 official rule library:
# FRACTINT | SnowFlake1 { ; Adrian Mariano
# FRACTINT | ; from The Fractal Geometry of Nature by Mandelbrot
# FRACTINT |   Angle 12
# FRACTINT |   Axiom FR
# FRACTINT |   R=++!FRFU++FU++FU!---@Q3FU|-@IQ3!FRFU!
# FRACTINT |   U=!FRFU!|+@Q3FR@IQ3+++!FR--FR--FRFU!--
# FRACTINT |   F=
